{"id":"n61190-30-7","stage":0,"title":"보다 · 看","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61190-30-7-1","ko":"남자 친구랑은 주로 언제 만나서 놀아?","zh":"你一般什么时候和男朋友见面玩？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"남자","meaning":"男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","explanation":"남자：男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"3","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"친구랑은","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주로","meaning":"主要","explanation":"주로：主要","readings":[{"term":"주로","audio":"/audio/082e27671571beef0683.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91767","senseId":"1","lemma":"주로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언제","meaning":"哪天，哪会儿","explanation":"언제：哪天，哪会儿","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만나서","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놀아?","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c6a3b6d97217b4d8","term":"남자","zh":"男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3","entryId":"60865","definition":"男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","pronunciation":["남자"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"082e27671571beef","term":"주로","zh":"主要","audio":"/audio/082e27671571beef0683.mp3","entryId":"91767","definition":"成为基本或重心地。","pronunciation":["주로"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"哪天，哪会儿","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不明确指定的未来某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"见面，相逢","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"其中一人来或去，二人因而相见。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩耍，玩乐","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩着游戏等度过有趣、愉快的时光。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9ebfca44090e85e3b326.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61190-30-7-2","ko":"보통은 금요일 저녁이나 토요일에 봐.","zh":"通常是周五晚上或者周六见面。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"보통은","meaning":"普通，一般","explanation":"보통：普通，一般；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"보통","audio":"/audio/666599febd987f532ea6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65572","senseId":"1","lemma":"보통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"금요일","meaning":"星期五，周五，礼拜五","explanation":"금요일：星期五，周五，礼拜五","readings":[{"term":"금요일","audio":"/audio/a594e9b583050ec46ff9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17289","senseId":"1","lemma":"금요일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저녁이나","meaning":"傍晚","explanation":"저녁：傍晚；이나：连接可以选择的名词，表示“或、或者”。","readings":[{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71220","senseId":"1","lemma":"저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"토요일에","meaning":"星期六，周六，礼拜六","explanation":"토요일：星期六，周六，礼拜六；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"토요일","audio":"/audio/9f4eef79554b65d023ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30214","senseId":"1","lemma":"토요일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看，见，见面","explanation":"보다：看，见，见面；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"30","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"666599febd987f53","term":"보통","zh":"普通，一般","audio":"/audio/666599febd987f532ea6.mp3","entryId":"65572","definition":"一般性地；或指通常。","pronunciation":["보ː통"]},{"id":"a594e9b583050ec4","term":"금요일","zh":"星期五，周五，礼拜五","audio":"/audio/a594e9b583050ec46ff9.mp3","entryId":"17289","definition":"以星期一为基准，指一个星期中的第五天。","pronunciation":["그묘일"]},{"id":"8d3c547011f433e6","term":"저녁","zh":"傍晚","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3","entryId":"71220","definition":"从太阳落山开始到晚上的时间。","pronunciation":["저녁"]},{"id":"9f4eef79554b65d0","term":"토요일","zh":"星期六，周六，礼拜六","audio":"/audio/9f4eef79554b65d023ca.mp3","entryId":"30214","definition":"以星期一为基准，指一个星期中的第六天。","pronunciation":["토요일"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，见，见面","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"与别人相见。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a2094c19724e9fc800f9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.72,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61190","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"30","sourceLevel":"초급","day":8,"sequenceScore":0.1212,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["通常是周五晚上或者周六见面。","喂，看我一下。","你一般什么时候和男朋友见面玩？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["通常是周五晚上或者周六见面。","你一般什么时候和男朋友见面玩？","喂，看我一下。"],"answer":0}]}
